Package: polished
Title: Download and Clean WHO POLIS Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Mohamed A.",
           family = "Yusuf",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mohamedayusuf87@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9339-4613"))
Description: Downloads data from the WHO POLIS OData API and cleans it
    for analysis. Handles POLIS's Id-range pagination and year-aligned
    date filters, supports incremental updates with per-batch
    checkpointing and parallel year-fetching, and provides per-stream
    cleaners that produce analysis-ready tables.
